# Duelist of the Mind: "you may draw": on its crime Bot1 declines, so nothing is drawn and nothing is discarded; its power stays 0.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Duelist of the Mind
Lightning Bolt
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Duelist of the Mind.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Decline
[Bot1.Main2]

